          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "컨테이너가 호스트의 네트워크를 공유합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Content Credentials are signed, but Vitrine does not verify the signature: treat them as a claim, not proof." : {
      "comment" : "Provenance warning.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Content Credentials sind signiert, aber Vitrine prüft die Signatur nicht: Betrachte sie als Behauptung, nicht als Beweis."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les Content Credentials sont signés, mais Vitrine ne vérifie pas la signature : considérez-les comme une affirmation, pas une preuve."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Content Credentialsには署名がありますが、Vitrineは署名を検証しません。証明ではなく主張として扱ってください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Content Credentials에 서명이 있지만 Vitrine은 서명을 확인하지 않습니다. 증거가 아닌 주장으로 보세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Content Credentials carry no signature, so anyone could have written them." : {
      "comment" : "Provenance warning.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Content Credentials haben keine Signatur, daher könnte sie jeder geschrieben haben."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les Content Credentials n’ont pas de signature : n’importe qui a pu les écrire."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Content Credentialsに署名がないため、誰でも書けた可能性があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Content Credentials에 서명이 없어 누구나 작성했을 수 있습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cover art is %@, over the %@ shown in previews." : {
